&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Building in areas including Object Detection, Tracking and guidance, target re-identification&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Working through software design, and architecture, all the way through to implementation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Integrating onto our hardware in real time&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Stay current with emerging technologies and industry trends, recommending and implementing innovations to improve our products and processes&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dive deep into the details to identify, understand, and solve difficult technical problems&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
