&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Advanced use of Python and strong in C++&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
