&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills and the ability to troubleshoot and resolve issues&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills to work effectively in a multidisciplinary team environment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
