&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adaptability to work in a fast-paced, dynamic startup environment with a strong drive for innovation and continuous improvement&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
